  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "R7-QA2-RQA-QA-003" ;
  triage:title "The worst-case doc says 'about 17 minutes' for both LLM backends plus Jev" ;
  triage:description "The worst-case doc says 'about 17 minutes' for both LLM backends plus Jev. By the doc's own arithmetic that is 2x420 s + Jev. If Jev also gets the 90 s busy-retry budget, it is 2x420 + 210 = 1050 s, about 17.5 minutes. If it does not, the doc should say 960 s (16 minutes). The doc does not say which." ;
